    "body": "I looks like https://wicg.github.io/IntersectionObserver/ operates on the layout viewport and isn't affected by pinch zoom, so I think https://drafts.csswg.org/css2/visuren.html#viewport which you've linked to is correct. In order to not give the impression that the \"user\" bit might modify the meaning of this term, I will remove it. I'll also rename the concept \"intersect the viewport\" to not invite interpretations that require end-user visibility.\n",
