    "body": "Some wording change is needed to make this a non-blocking wait, i.e. the  `canplaythrough` event should be fired before these steps are run. But I think a consequence of this will be that for video elements, the order of the `canplaythrough` and `playing` events will change even if the element is already visible. Otherwise one would need to force a sync layout here, and that would be rather bad.\n",
